{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-01.png?t=1748540815\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide a tiny traveller on an epic journey across alien worlds. Solaro takes you into the heart of a mysterious galaxy, where natural forces like gravity, wind, and solar energy guide your movements. Master the art of space exploration from an alien point of view, as you unravel the mysteries of your forgotten past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/holu.gif?t=1748540815\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-02.png?t=1748540815\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ancient legend tells of a race of beings who could travel the stars as easily as fish swimming across the ocean... Solaro tells the story of one traveller, lost and adrift in a world that pulsates with a life of its own. Whether you're exploring a natural wonder like a gas giant or planetary geyser, or unlocking the eerie secrets of a technological ruin, Solaro's environments are constantly evolving, moved by ancient and powerful forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/ship.gif?t=1748540815\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-03.png?t=1748540815\" />Explore without boundaries...Solaro's open-world design encourages you to chart your own path, letting you master the game's unique mechanics at your own pace. Puzzles and challenges are around every corner, and build in complexity as your knowledge increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-04.png?t=1748540815\" />Solaro was created by a solo developer over several years, using the open-source game engine Libgdx. It offers an immersive world to explore, with vibrant art, a full soundtrack, and a whole new take on space exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/marketing_headings-05.png?t=1748540815\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ vibrant alien worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ unique &quot;orbital puzzles&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ hours of core gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ hours of optional features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ collectibles and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.5 hours of original music </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1602740?t=1748540815","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/87cd48f6196a1a750d99a72843fda0e351b69231/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748540815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/3ee03fbaa2f900ecf67d99970527cbf2bf3673a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748540815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/3ee03fbaa2f900ecf67d99970527cbf2bf3673a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748540815","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description"